                  'link</strong>. The address usually looks like <em>youtu.be/</em> followed by an eleven-character '
                  'ID.</li><li>Switch to your browser. Do not close YouTube; you can come back to it later.</li></ol>\n'
                  '<p>If you are on a playlist page, open the single video first. Sharing a playlist address can '
                  'confuse converters, and you will usually get one item or an error instead of the whole list.</p>\n'
                  '<h2 id="convert-the-link-in-safari-or-chrome">Step 2: Convert the Link in Safari or Chrome</h2>\n'
