                  'input box, press and hold, and choose <strong>Paste</strong>. On iOS you may see a small prompt '
                  'asking whether to allow pasting from another app; allow it once.</p>\n'
                  '<ol><li>Paste the link and tap the convert button.</li><li>Wait while the page reads the video '
