                  'connection.</li><li>Pick an audio quality if offered. 128 kbps suits speech, while 192 kbps or '
                  'higher is a sensible choice for music. Our <a '
                  'href="/blog/mp3-bitrate-explained-128-192-256-320-kbps">MP3 bitrate guide</a> shows what the '
