                  '<h2 id="fixing-common-android-problems">Fixing Common Android Problems</h2>\n'
                  '<ul><li><strong>Download blocked or failed.</strong> Check that Chrome has storage permission under '
                  '<strong>Settings</strong>, <strong>Apps</strong>, <strong>Chrome</strong>, '
                  '<strong>Permissions</strong>, and that you have free space.</li><li><strong>File saved with a '
                  'strange extension.</strong> Rename it so it ends in .mp3, then try opening it '
