                  'MB</td><td>about 140 MB</td></tr></tbody></table>\n'
                  '<ul><li>Use 128 kbps for talks, interviews and lectures, where voice clarity matters more than '
                  'fidelity.</li><li>Keep one folder per project or course so you can delete whole batches when you '
                  'finish.</li><li>Back up files you want to keep to a computer or cloud drive, then remove local '
