                  'space audio actually uses before deleting anything else.</li></ul>\n'
                  '<p>If you are saving recordings you made yourself, the <a '
                  'href="/blog/archive-your-own-youtube-uploads-and-lectures-offline">guide to backing up your own '
                  'uploads and building an offline study library</a> suggests a folder structure that scales.</p>\n'
                  '<h2 id="battery-tips">Battery and Data Tips</h2>\n'
                  '<p>Converting and downloading are short tasks, but a few settings help you avoid wasting power or '
