                  'tab goes to the background.</li><li>Lower screen brightness while waiting, since the display uses '
                  'more power than the conversion itself.</li><li>Offline playback from a local MP3 uses far less '
                  'battery than streaming the same track repeatedly over mobile data.</li><li>Close extra tabs '
                  'afterwards so the browser is not running in the background.</li></ul>\n'
                  '<h2 id="good-practice">Good Practice and Respect for Creators</h2>\n'
                  '<p>Convenience should never replace permission. Use these tools for your own uploads, material '
                  'published under a Creative Commons licence, public-domain recordings and content whose owner has '
